Derived work
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This project is a modified derivative of **WeDetect** (GPL-3.0):
  Fu, Su, Rao, Lyu, Xie, Zheng. "WeDetect: Fast Open-Vocabulary Object
  Detection as Retrieval." CVPR 2026. arXiv:2512.12309.
  Upstream weights: https://huggingface.co/fushh7/WeDetect
Audited source snapshot: WeChatCV/WeDetect@1903f09542ef39feae1a962da193f4c602d9899f.
Significant changes over upstream WeDetect include: the PentaCyto multi-domain
cytopathology benchmark data pipeline (taxonomy, organ masking, base/novel
splits, structured cytomorphology prompt banks); the CytoSPM structural
prompt-matching detection head (Top-P / Top-Q mutual selection, three-term
matching score, structural-matching warm-up); organ-restricted evaluation
metrics; and the removal of the COCO/LVIS/WeDetect-Uni/WeDetect-Ref surfaces.

